# Language classification (GitHub Linguist).
#
# Linguist classifies by byte count, and the test harness is comparable
# in size to the program (test-dec2base.sh ~7.0 KB vs dec2base.c
# ~8.9 KB). When the script was the larger of the two the repo was
# reported as Shell and did not appear under `language:c` -- the most
# likely way someone looks for a C big-integer converter.
#
# Marking the test script as not detectable pins C as the primary
# language regardless of how the two files grow. The script is still
# syntax-highlighted as Shell.

test-dec2base.sh linguist-detectable=false

*.c linguist-language=C
*.h linguist-language=C
